:: Deadwood Reblooms Deviancy Mirror Enter
<<location 'tentworld'>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<tentacleworldintro>><<set $tentacleEntrance to 'mirror'>>
<<set _mirrorArrival to $VanillaPlus.deviancy.mirror_locations[$VanillaPlus.deviancy.mirror]>>
<<if _mirrorArrival>>
  <<set $tentnorth to _mirrorArrival.north>>
  <<set $tenteast to _mirrorArrival.east>>
<</if>>
<<if $VanillaPlus.deviancy.mirror_day isnot Time.days>>
  <<set $VanillaPlus.deviancy.mirror_day to Time.days>><<deviancy6>>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    The glass clings to your skin like a <span class="purple">wet membrane</span>. You force your body through and spill out beneath the
    alien sky of the tentacle plains.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    镜面如<span class="purple">湿润的薄膜</span>般贴紧你的皮肤。你用力挤过镜面，跌落在触手平原上。头顶是陌生的天空。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<lanLink ["Continue","继续"] 'Tentacle Plains'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Deviancy Mirror Home
<<set $location to 'home'>><<set $outside to 0>><<deadwood-reblooms-mirror-exit 'home'>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You force yourself through the rippling surface and tumble <span class="green">back into your bedroom</span>.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你挤过荡漾的镜面，<span class="green">跌回自己的卧室</span>。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<lanLink ["Continue","继续"] 'Bedroom'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Deviancy Mirror Property
<<if $VanillaPlus.deviancy.mirror_property and maplebirch.get("Finance") and maplebirch.get("Finance").realEstate.visit($VanillaPlus.deviancy.mirror_property)>>
  <<run maplebirch.get("Finance").realEstate.enter()>>
  <<set _deviancyMirrorExit to 'property:' + $VanillaPlus.deviancy.mirror_property>>
  <<deadwood-reblooms-mirror-exit _deviancyMirrorExit>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You push through the glass and find <span class="green">your own bedroom</span> on the other side. The air smells of the house again.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你挤过镜面，<span class="green">回到了自己的卧室</span>。房间熟悉的气息重新包围了你。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<lanLink ["Continue","继续"] 'Deadwood Reblooms Property Bedroom'>><</lanLink>>
<<else>>
  <<set $location to 'home'>><<set $outside to 0>><<deadwood-reblooms-mirror-exit>>
  <<lanLink ["Continue","继续"] 'Bedroom'>><</lanLink>>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Deviancy Mirror Farm
<<set $location to 'farm'>><<set $outside to 0>><<deadwood-reblooms-mirror-exit 'farm'>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You force yourself through the rippling surface and stumble <span class="green">into your room at the farm</span>.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你挤过荡漾的镜面，踉跄着<span class="green">落进农场的房间</span>。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<lanLink ["Continue","继续"] 'Farm Bedroom'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Deviancy Mirror Tower
<<set $location to 'tower'>><<set $outside to 0>><<deadwood-reblooms-mirror-exit 'tower'>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You force yourself through the rippling surface and spill <span class="green">onto the tower floor</span>.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你挤过荡漾的镜面，<span class="green">摔落在高塔的地面上</span>。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<lanLink ["Continue","继续"] 'Bird Tower'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Deviancy Mirror Temple
<<set $location to 'temple'>><<set $outside to 0>><<deadwood-reblooms-mirror-exit 'temple'>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You force yourself through the rippling surface and stumble <span class="green">back beside your bunk</span> in the temple quarters.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你挤过荡漾的镜面，踉跄着<span class="green">回到神殿宿舍的床铺旁</span>。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<lanLink ["Continue","继续"] 'Temple Bunk'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Deviancy Mirror Sirris
<<if !maplebirch.get('Sydney') or !$SydneyExpansion.estate.invited or !isLoveInterest('Sydney')>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The mirror shows only the tentacle plains beyond it.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      镜面另一侧仍是触手平原。
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<lanLink ['Continue', '继续'] 'Tentacle Plains'>><</lanLink>>
<<else>>
  <<deadwood-reblooms-sirris-estate-presence>>
  <<if !_sydneyAtEstate>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Sydney's room is empty. The surface refuses to let you through.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        悉尼的房间空着。镜面没有让你穿过去。
    <</language>><br><br>
    <<lanLink ['Continue', '继续'] 'Tentacle Plains'>><</lanLink>>
  <<else>>
    <<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'sirris_estate'>><<deadwood-reblooms-mirror-exit 'sirris'>>
    <<npc Sydney>><<person1>><<run statusCheck('Sydney')>>
    <<set _nakedArrival to $worn.over_upper.type.includes('naked')
      and $worn.over_lower.type.includes('naked')
      and $worn.upper.type.includes('naked')
      and $worn.lower.type.includes('naked')
      and $worn.under_upper.type.includes('naked')
      and $worn.under_lower.type.includes('naked')>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You squeeze through the glass and land beside Sydney's desk. <<He>> looks up from the bed. The mirror settles behind you without a sound.
        <<if _nakedArrival and (Time.hour gte 22 or Time.hour lt 6)>>
          <br><br>
          <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>>
            Sydney catches sight of your bare skin and quickly pulls the blanket aside. <span class='teal'>"Come here before you get cold,"</span> <<he>> whispers, cheeks warm.
          <<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes('corrupt')>>
            Sydney's eyes travel over you. <span class='lewd'>"You came all this way dressed like that?"</span> <<he>> asks, smiling as <<he>> lifts the blanket.
          <<else>>
            Sydney blinks at your naked body, then moves over in bed. "Is that mirror how you got here?" <<he>> asks softly.
          <</if>>
          <<if _sirrisAtEstate>>
            A floorboard creaks downstairs. Sydney glances at the door and lowers <<his>> voice.
          <</if>>
        <</if>>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你挤过镜面，落在悉尼的书桌旁。<<He>>从床上抬起头。身后的镜子无声地恢复平静。
        <<if _nakedArrival and (Time.hour gte 22 or Time.hour lt 6)>>
          <br><br>
          <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>>
            悉尼瞥见你赤裸的身体，连忙掀开被角。<span class='teal'>“快过来，别着凉。”</span><<he>>低声说，脸颊渐渐发热。
          <<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes('corrupt')>>
            悉尼的目光沿着你的身体扫过。<span class='lewd'>“你就这样一路过来的？”</span><<he>>笑着掀开被角。
          <<else>>
            悉尼望着你赤裸的身体眨了眨眼，往床里挪出空位。“你是从镜子里过来的？”<<he>>轻声问。
          <</if>>
          <<if _sirrisAtEstate>>
            楼下有块地板响了一声。悉尼看向门口，压低声音。
          <</if>>
        <</if>>
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
    <<if _nakedArrival and (Time.hour gte 22 or Time.hour lt 6)>>
      <<loveicon>><<lanLink ['Join Sydney under the blanket', '钻进悉尼的被窝'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Mirror Night Visit'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <</if>>
    <<getouticon>><<lanLink ["Stay in Sydney's room", '留在悉尼的房间'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Sydney Room'>><</lanLink>>
  <</if>>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Mirror Night Visit
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'sirris_estate'>><<effects>>
<<deadwood-reblooms-sirris-estate-presence>>
<<if !_sydneyAtEstate or !isLoveInterest('Sydney')>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You cannot stay with Sydney here right now.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      现在没法留在这里陪悉尼。
  <</language>><br><br>
<<else>>
  <<npc Sydney>><<person1>><<run statusCheck('Sydney')>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You slip beneath the blanket. Sydney catches your hand before you can surprise <<him>> again.
      <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>> <span class='teal'>"You could have knocked,"</span> <<he>> whispers, though <<he>> keeps your hand in <<his>>.
      <<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes('corrupt')>> <span class='lewd'>"Was the mirror only an excuse to get into my bed?"</span> <<he>> asks, drawing you closer.
      <<else>> "I wondered if you'd visit tonight," <<he>> says, making room for you.
      <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你钻进被窝。悉尼抓住你的手，没让你再吓到<<him>>。
      <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>> <span class='teal'>“你可以先敲门。”</span><<he>>小声说，却仍握着你的手。
      <<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes('corrupt')>> <span class='lewd'>“镜子只是你钻进我被窝的借口？”</span><<he>>问着，把你拉近。
      <<else>> “我还在想，你今晚会不会来。”<<he>>说着，往旁边挪了挪。
      <</if>>
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<loveicon>><<lanLink ['Draw Sydney closer', '把悉尼拉近'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Sydney Intimacy'>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</lanLink>><<promiscuous1>><br>
<</if>>
<<bedicon>><<lanLink ["Stay by Sydney's side", '留在悉尼身边'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Sydney Room'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Deviancy Mirror Kylar
<<if !maplebirch.get('Kylar') or !$KylarExpansion.stay_invited or !isLoveInterest('Kylar')
  or C.npc.Kylar.state isnot 'active'
  or (Time.hour lt 18 and getKylarLocation().area isnot 'manor_bedroom')
  or (maplebirch.get('Finance') and maplebirch.get("Finance").realEstate.residenceOf('Kylar'))>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Kylar's room is out of reach. The mirror stays dark.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      凯拉尔的房间遥不可及。镜面仍是一片黑暗。
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<lanLink ['Continue', '继续'] 'Tentacle Plains'>><</lanLink>>
<<else>>
  <<set $outside to 0>><<location 'kylarmanor'>><<deadwood-reblooms-mirror-exit 'kylar'>>
  <<npc Kylar>><<person1>>
  <<set _nakedArrival to $worn.over_upper.type.includes('naked')
    and $worn.over_lower.type.includes('naked')
    and $worn.upper.type.includes('naked')
    and $worn.lower.type.includes('naked')
    and $worn.under_upper.type.includes('naked')
    and $worn.under_lower.type.includes('naked')>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You tumble out of the mirror in Kylar's room. <<He>> spins in <<his>> chair, one hand already reaching beneath the desk. When <<he>> recognises you, <<he>> lets it fall.
      <<if _nakedArrival and (Time.hour gte 22 or Time.hour lt 6)>>
        <br><br>
        Kylar's gaze catches on your bare skin. <span class='lewd'>"I thought you were a stranger,"</span> <<he>> says, pulling the sheets back for you.
      <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你从凯拉尔房间的镜子里跌出来。<<He>>猛地转过椅子，一只手已经探向桌下。认出你后，<<he>>才松开手。
      <<if _nakedArrival and (Time.hour gte 22 or Time.hour lt 6)>>
        <br><br>
        凯拉尔的目光落在你赤裸的身体上。<span class='lewd'>“我还以为是陌生人。”</span><<he>>说着，为你掀开被子。
      <</if>>
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<bedicon 'kylar'>><<lanLink ["Stay in Kylar's room", '留在凯拉尔的房间'] 'Manor Kylar Room'>><</lanLink>>
<</if>>
